      70.56,
      381.9,
      545.64,
      416.0
    ],
    "text": "My Number: DSO/HOM/LAC/102. Land Ministry reference Number: 4-3/17/2017/e/142.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613,
      11.038795471191406
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      417.89,
      287.16,
      501.17
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice, under sub-section (1) of section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition(Amendment)Act,No.28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land which is required for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613,
      11.998800277709961
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      502.63,
      286.69,
      604.64
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land to be acquired: The land under mentioned name and the extent which is depicted as lot No. 115 in sheet 06, Zone 01, in the Cadastral map No. 520008 dated 25.10.2017 prepared by the Surveyor General, situated at Grama Niladhari Division No.587, Mattegoda West in Homagama Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Colombo District Western Province Boundaries.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      606.08,
      309.01,
      662.28
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 115 \u2014 Kekunagahawaththa; Original claimant: Prime Lands Private Limited of No. 75, D. S. Senanayake Mawatha, Colombo 08; Extent: 4.0469 Hectare. (10 Acres) in extent.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.08,
      663.43,
      286.71,
      673.52
    ],
    "text": "North: Zone 03 of Cadastral map 520029, lot No. 114",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      346.64,
      539.43,
      414.08
    ],
    "text": "and Block 01 of Cadastral map 520029 (Road, Road Development Authority), East: Lot No.114, Block 01 of Cadastral map 520029 (Road, Road Development Authority) and lot No.116. South: Lot No.116, 6 and Block 02; West: Block 02, block 07 of Cadastral map 520029 and Block 03 of Cadastral map 520029.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      415.24,
      539.4,
      549.92
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land on which is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Homagama Divisional Secretary\u2019s Office on the 19th day of February, 2018 at 9.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing in duplicate on or before the 01st day of February, 2018 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation and the details of the compensation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.91920804977417,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
